Activation Tips: Add donation links everywhere: GitHub README, zelavis.dev homepage, package docs, X bio.  
Custom tiers: Offer badges, shoutouts, or "sponsor a feature" for bigger donors.  
Promote: In release notes/X posts, say "Help sustain zelavis — donate here!" Tie it to impact (e.g., "Your donations fund new packages like auth!").  
Legal/Taxes: If donations grow (> $10K/year), consult a tax pro. Open Collective handles a lot via fiscal hosts.

Self-Sustainability Goal: Start with personal time; use early donations for domain/hosting (~$100/year). As community grows, allocate funds to bounties ($50-200 for issues) or part-time maintainers. Projects like Prettier or Babel sustain this way.

